{"2432230": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Glitter Justice", "steam_appid": 2432230, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this unapologetically feminine <strong>FPS</strong>, take on rogue robots with grace and glamour. Why choose between <strong>cute</strong> and <strong>badass</strong> when you can be both? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip an arsenal full of charm and chaos: toss a <strong>glitter bomb</strong> for a flashy entrance, fire <strong>laser hearts</strong>, unleash <strong>bubble cannons</strong>, or slice gracefully through enemies with the elegance of your <strong>cherry blossom-pink katana</strong>. Or get weird<strong>, launch a cat</strong> straight into a robot’s face. </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this unapologetically feminine <strong>FPS</strong>, take on rogue robots with grace and glamour. Why choose between <strong>cute</strong> and <strong>badass</strong> when you can be both? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip an arsenal full of charm and chaos: toss a <strong>glitter bomb</strong> for a flashy entrance, fire <strong>laser hearts</strong>, unleash <strong>bubble cannons</strong>, or slice gracefully through enemies with the elegance of your <strong>cherry blossom-pink katana</strong>. Or get weird<strong>, launch a cat</strong> straight into a robot’s face. </p>", "short_description": "Who decided an FPS always has to be dark, gritty, and dreadful? Say goodbye to the gloom and doom and step into gameplay filled with sparkles and vibrant colors. Embrace your inner sci-fi magical girl and shoot hearts and glitter around!", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2432230/header.jpg?t=1780912104", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2432230/cbc5825e2da99891f6790f774c60b4e0b270d3c2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1780912104